WEBVTT

00:06:59.123 --> 00:07:02.751
China is currently trying to gain
access to more mineral resources

00:07:02.751 --> 00:07:04.712
through its Belt and Road Initiative.

00:07:05.463 --> 00:07:07.465
The United States and Europe

00:07:07.465 --> 00:07:10.968
are both thinking
of reshoring critical mining

00:07:11.010 --> 00:07:12.344
and processing

00:07:12.344 --> 00:07:15.598
and orienting some
of their international partnerships

00:07:15.639 --> 00:07:19.101
to facilitate access to more
mineral resources.

00:07:19.810 --> 00:07:26.233
Japan is exploring some of its
oceanic marine reserves

00:07:26.233 --> 00:07:28.527
to build strategic reserves.